  "@walletParkedAuthorizeSent": {
    "description": "Snackbar after a parked send was signed in the authorization bracket (FR-23-b): it is now a real transaction on its way. It leaves the pending-payments list and appears in activity. Present progressive on purpose — reaching the network is still in progress."
